a thorn wasp swarm~
a thorn wasp swarm~
A deadly cloud of stinging wasps, each the size of a human hand, fills the air with their
angry buzzing. Their thorax is covered in thorn-like barbs. They move with coordinated purpose,
a single predatory intelligence controlling the swarm.
~
This creature is a swarm of giant wasps covered in thorn-like barbs along their bodies. They move
as a single coordinated unit despite their numbers, responding to a single predatory will. Their
stingers drip with venom, and their wings make a sound like a thousand tiny blades. Each wasp is
lethal; the swarm is a plague.
~
