a barkskin wolf~
a barkskin wolf~
A large wolf stalks through the forest, its fur hardened into bark-like plating. Where a
normal wolf is graceful, this creature is armored. Its eyes glow with feral intelligence.
It is death wrapped in wood and hunger.
~
This creature is a wolf with bark-hardened hide that serves as natural armor. Its body is lean
and muscular, built for speed and endurance. Thick bark plates overlay its fur, providing
protection while maintaining mobility. Its teeth are sharp as obsidian, and its claws can tear
through stone.
~
