#10047
a deepwood centipede~
a deepwood centipede~
A giant centipede crawls through the undergrowth, its segments the size of large dogs. Venom
drips from its numerous fangs, and each leg ends in a sharp point capable of piercing armor.
It is an ancient predator of the deep forest.
~
This creature is a giant venomous centipede perfectly adapted for life in the deepwood. Its
segments are armored in thick chitin plates that shimmer with an iridescent sheen. Its numerous
legs move with hypnotic coordination. Venom drips from its fangs and coats each segment. Its
bite injects a poison that paralyzes prey.
~
