#10048
a bog troll~
a bog troll~
A massive troll covered entirely in moss and bog growth lumbers toward you. Its skin is more
swamp than flesh, and its movements are deceptively quick. It reeks of stagnant water and decay.
Despite its bulk, it is a predatory hunter.
~
This creature is a troll transformed by life in the deepwood bogs. Its body is covered in thick
moss that acts as camouflage and armor. Its movements are fluid and deceptively fast despite its
massive bulk. Algae drips from its hide, and the smell of stagnant water precedes it. Its strength
is immense, capable of bending iron.
~
