a fungal broodmother~
a fungal broodmother~
A massive fungal creature towers before you, its form a grotesque mushroom given terrible life.
Its cap is the size of a small building, pulsing with bioluminescent light. Spore clouds
constantly pour from its gills in sickening plumes. This is the matriarch of fungal horrors.
~
This creature is a giant fungal matriarch, a living mushroom the size of a small house. Its cap
is covered in a network of glowing veins that pulse with bio-luminescent light. Its gills are
exposed and drip with caustic fungal matter. Spore clouds pour from it constantly, each spore
a potential vector for infection. Its movements are slow but crushing.
~
